//RS /// D-CLIFLAG1 / D-CLI-GLOBAL1=E: field and command help for CLI-derived
//RS /// arguments. D-TASKS-LIST1=A reuses
//RS /// it only when the function marker group also contains `#Job`.
//RS pub const MARKER_DOC: &str = "Doc"; // D-CLIFLAG1, D-CLI-GLOBAL1=E
//RS /// D-CLI-POS1=A: field-level opt-out from positional filling on a `#[CLI]`
//RS /// required value field — `#[Flag]`. Without it, required scalars fill from
